    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun oddly-shaped puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.poster.avif?t=1741282114\" width=732 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.webm?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.mp4?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And we have cute cats too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.poster.avif?t=1741282114\" width=742 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.webm?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.mp4?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mischievous Cat Led Me to Develop a Relaxing Puzzle Game! \ud83d\udc31\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of inspiration for this game, I must tell you about my adorable Pipi! A white cat who's both beautiful and naughty! \ud83e\udd0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/df3ceb24803d7e97131366d73d070c4f.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/860d99242815b7f1bdb5a00641f991ac.avif?t=1741282114\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at this cutie! Usually so peaceful and heart-melting... BUT!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My heart skips a beat every time I see them crouching at the table edge, pawing at things! \ud83d\ude31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that innocent face!! That's the expression they make after causing chaos! So annoying yet adorable!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/e2828a1b3e6bfaf2f57d1f691da60ec6.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my daily &quot;torment&quot; (just kidding) from Pipi, I developed &quot;Magic Puzzle King 2: Rolling Cat&quot; \ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/0397931112cb9e4e126a07823a301500.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super fun game concept:<br>\u2728 The protagonist is a mischievous cat (based on Pipi, of course!)<br>\u2728 Levels designed around cats and their furry friends<br>\u2728 Each level features items broken by our feline overlords<br>\u2728 Players solve puzzles to restore the broken items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>\ud83c\udfaf Progressive difficulty, 15 levels from easy to challenging<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Soothing music for stress relief<br>\ud83c\udf08 Fresh artistic style with adorable cats<br>\ud83c\udfae Simple controls, fun for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special highlights:<br>\ud83d\udc9d Cute cats randomly appear to &quot;help&quot; you solve puzzles<br>\ud83d\udc9d Base game with 15 levels completely free<br>\ud83d\udc9d Multiple DLCs featuring cats and their adorable friends, plus extra levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cat servant tortured by my feline master to a game developer - I guess this is what cat ownership leads to! \ud83e\udd70</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun oddly-shaped puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.poster.avif?t=1741282114\" width=732 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.webm?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/a66f969605683bc4d23de737ff4b5cc9.mp4?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And we have cute cats too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.poster.avif?t=1741282114\" width=742 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.webm?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/c06c4c343a32806f01109ee78af16bb8.mp4?t=1741282114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mischievous Cat Led Me to Develop a Relaxing Puzzle Game! \ud83d\udc31\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speaking of inspiration for this game, I must tell you about my adorable Pipi! A white cat who's both beautiful and naughty! \ud83e\udd0d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/df3ceb24803d7e97131366d73d070c4f.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/860d99242815b7f1bdb5a00641f991ac.avif?t=1741282114\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look at this cutie! Usually so peaceful and heart-melting... BUT!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My heart skips a beat every time I see them crouching at the table edge, pawing at things! \ud83d\ude31</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that innocent face!! That's the expression they make after causing chaos! So annoying yet adorable!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/e2828a1b3e6bfaf2f57d1f691da60ec6.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=530 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by my daily &quot;torment&quot; (just kidding) from Pipi, I developed &quot;Magic Puzzle King 2: Rolling Cat&quot; \ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330220/extras/0397931112cb9e4e126a07823a301500.avif?t=1741282114\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super fun game concept:<br>\u2728 The protagonist is a mischievous cat (based on Pipi, of course!)<br>\u2728 Levels designed around cats and their furry friends<br>\u2728 Each level features items broken by our feline overlords<br>\u2728 Players solve puzzles to restore the broken items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:<br>\ud83c\udfaf Progressive difficulty, 15 levels from easy to challenging<br>\ud83c\udfb5 Soothing music for stress relief<br>\ud83c\udf08 Fresh artistic style with adorable cats<br>\ud83c\udfae Simple controls, fun for all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special highlights:<br>\ud83d\udc9d Cute cats randomly appear to &quot;help&quot; you solve puzzles<br>\ud83d\udc9d Base game with 15 levels completely free<br>\ud83d\udc9d Multiple DLCs featuring cats and their adorable friends, plus extra levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cat servant tortured by my feline master to a game developer - I guess this is what cat ownership leads to! \ud83e\udd70</p>",
